<h2><sup><sub>
<h2><span style=3D"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);">Voter Information</span></h2>
</sub></sup></h2>
<ul>
    <li><span style=3D"text-decoration: underline;"><strong>VOTER REGISTRAT=
ION:</strong></span> Register to vote, update your voter registration or ch=
eck your registration status on <a href=3D"https://registertovote.nv.gov/" =
target=3D"_blank" rel=3D"noopener" tabindex=3D"-1">VOTE.NV.gov</a>.
    <ul>
        <li>To learn more about voter registration and eligibility in Nevad=
a,&nbsp;<a href=3D"https://www.nvsos.gov/elections/voters/registering-to-vo=
te/voter-registration-verification-process" style=3D"font-size: inherit;" t=
arget=3D"_blank" rel=3D"noopener" tabindex=3D"-1">click here</a><span style=
=3D"background-color: transparent; color: inherit; font-size: inherit;"><a =
href=3D"https://www.nvsos.gov/elections/voters/registering-to-vote/voter-re=
gistration-verification-process" tabindex=3D"-1">.</a></span></li>
    </ul>
    </li>
</ul>
<ul>
    <li><span style=3D"text-decoration: underline;"><strong>POLLING LOCATIO=
NS:</strong></span> Find a polling location or mail ballot dropbox in your =
county <a href=3D"https://www.nvsos.gov/elections/election-information/2026=
-election-information/2026-polling-locations" tabindex=3D"-1">HERE.</a>
    <ul>
        <li>Early Voting for the November General runs October 17th through=
 October 30th. Election Day is November 3rd.</li>
    </ul>
    </li>
</ul>
<ul>
    <li><b><u>BALLOT TRACKING:</u></b> Track your mail ballot on <a href=3D=
"http://myballot.nv.gov/" target=3D"_blank" rel=3D"noopener" tabindex=3D"-1=
">MyBallot.NV.gov</a>&nbsp;
    <ul>
        <li>The Secretary of State's Office recommends mailing your ballot =
back at least a week before Election Day. Ballots can also be dropped off a=
t any official dropbox in your county up to the close of polls on Election =
Day.</li>
    </ul>
    </li>
</ul>
<ul>
    <li><span style=3D"text-decoration: underline;"><strong>RESULTS:</stron=
g></span>&nbsp; Unofficial election results will be posted on <a href=3D"ht=
tps://silverstateelection.nv.gov/" target=3D"_blank" rel=3D"noopener" tabin=
dex=3D"-1">Results.NV.gov</a> after the close of polls on November 3rd, 202=
6.</li>
</ul>
<ul>
    <li><span style=3D"text-decoration: underline;"><strong>CANVASS INFORMA=
TION:</strong></span>&nbsp;The canvass of the General Election must happen =
on or before the 10th day following Election Day, November 13. Election res=
ults are unofficial until the canvass is complete. Find city and county can=
vass dates and times <a href=3D"https://www.nvsos.gov/elections/election-in=
formation/2026-election-information/2026-canvass-information" target=3D"_bl=
ank" rel=3D"noopener">here</a>.</li>
</ul>
<ul>
    <li>Check off your&nbsp;<a href=3D"https://www.nvsos.gov/Home/Component=
s/News/News/3687/23?npage=3D2#!/" target=3D"_blank" rel=3D"noopener" tabind=
ex=3D"-1">2026 Voter Checklist</a>&nbsp;ahead of the 2026 elections!</li>
</ul>
<ul>
    <li>Click <a href=3D"https://www.nvsos.gov/home/showpublisheddocument/2=
0519/639233354596030000" target=3D"_blank" rel=3D"noopener">here for the 20=
