<h2>
</h2>
<p><span style=3D"font-family: &quot;Roboto Condensed&quot;, sans-serif; fo=
nt-size: 2rem; font-weight: 600; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);">General Election</=
span></p>
<p style=3D"margin-left: 40px;">The 2026 General Election will be held on T=
uesday, November 3, 2026.</p>
<p style=3D"margin-left: 40px;">The <a href=3D"https://www.nvsos.gov/ease/e=
asepages/overview.aspx" target=3D"_blank" rel=3D"noopener">Effective Absent=
ee System for Elections (EASE)</a> will be available to use not later than =
Friday, September 18, 2026 and will close with polls on election day.</p>
<p style=3D"margin-left: 40px;">Early voting starts Saturday, October 17, 2=
026 and goes through Friday, October 30, 2026.</p>
<p style=3D"margin-left: 40px;">2026 General Election polling locations wil=
l be posted here (pending).&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"margin-left: 40px;">2026 General Election results will be publi=
shed after the close of polls.&nbsp;</p>
<p><span style=3D"font-family: &quot;Roboto Condensed&quot;, sans-serif; fo=
nt-size: 2rem; font-weight: 600; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);">Primary Election</=
span></p>
<p style=3D"margin-left: 40px;">The 2026 Primary Election was held on&nbsp;=
<strong>Tuesday, June 9, 2026</strong>.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"margin-left: 40px;">The&nbsp;<a href=3D"https://www.nvsos.gov/e=
ase/easepages/overview.aspx" target=3D"_blank" rel=3D"noopener">Effective A=
bsentee System for Elections (EASE)</a>&nbsp;was available to use not later=
 than&nbsp;<strong>Friday, April 24, 2026</strong>&nbsp;and closed with pol=
ls on election day<strong>.</strong></p>
<p style=3D"margin-left: 40px;">Early Voting ran from&nbsp;<strong>Saturday=
, May 23, 2026</strong>&nbsp;through&nbsp;<strong>Friday, June 5, 2026.&nbs=
p;</strong></p>
<p style=3D"margin-left: 40px;">2026 Primary Election polling locations wer=
e posted&nbsp;<a href=3D"https://www.nvsos.gov/elections/election-informati=
on/2026-election-information/2026-polling-locations" tabindex=3D"-1">here</=
a>.&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"margin-left: 40px;">2026 Silver State Election results were pub=
lished after the close of polls <a href=3D"https://www.nvsos.gov/silverstat=
e2026pri/" target=3D"_blank" rel=3D"noopener">here</a>.</p>
